{"unit_id":"YSwo-fei__dsh-api-heal#card-zh","repo":"YSwo-fei/dsh-api-heal","commit":"23e4ef40d1b72dd88309f8f7e8b03b58b83cf00d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH API Heal 是面向 DSH Web 的凭据自愈插件。它监听请求认证失败，刷新 qoder、workbuddy-ai 或 our-free-model 凭据，并在成功后重试；也提供 heal_api 手动修复工具和状态路由。适合希望减少凭据失效造成请求中断的用户。刷新 our-free-model 需本机 connection 会话凭据。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:120","lib/index.js:187","lib/index.js:241","lib/heal.js:198"]}
