{"unit_id":"YSwo-fei__dsh-api-heal#feature-1","repo":"YSwo-fei/dsh-api-heal","commit":"23e4ef40d1b72dd88309f8f7e8b03b58b83cf00d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH API Heal 的功能「认证失败后自动恢复」：监听 agent/request-error，在识别到凭据类错误且不在冷却期时调用对应 provider 的刷新链路；刷新成功后返回 retry 让请求重发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:157","lib/index.js:169"]}
